{"term": {"label": "禮", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "三", "id": "三"}, {"form": "主", "id": "主"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "孔子", "id": "孔子"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.808956366410656, "source": "年", "target": "三"}, {"weight": 1.6739764335716716, "source": "年", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9616585060234524, "source": "年", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.249340578475233, "source": "義", "target": "三"}, {"weight": 3.060270794691562, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.8371272433773522, "source": "義", "target": "孔子"}, {"weight": 4.446565155811452, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.6548056865833978, "source": "義", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 1.7385149547092427, "source": "何", "target": "孔子"}, {"weight": 1.9616585060234524, "source": "三", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5939337258981352, "source": "仁", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.8371272433773522, "source": "孔子", "target": "主"}, {"weight": 3.9357395320454622, "source": "孔子", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.6776429940239801, "source": "孔子", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.1884686177899706, "source": "主", "target": "人"}]}}